(a) Cause to be made and preserved records containing adequate and proper documentation of the organization, function, policies, decisions, procedures and essential transactions of the agency and designed to furnish the information necessary to protect the legal and financial rights of the County and of persons directly affected by the activities of agency;
(b) Cooperate fully with the County in complying with this ordinance;
